        "cited_text": "Das Kerncurriculum umfasst vier Themenbereiche, von denen pro Semester ein Bereich",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "The order in which the topic areas are taught is not fixed; at the raised requirement level a qualitative and quantitative extension is assumed.",
