        },
        "cited_text": "Jedem Themenbereich sind vier Module (ein Pflichtmodul und drei Wahlmodule) zugeordnet.",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Of the 16 modules offered in total, at least four (the four compulsory modules) from the different topic areas must be taught during the Studienstufe.",
