          "section_anchor": "2.3 Inhalte",
          "printed_page": 13,
          "physical_page": 13
        },
        "cited_text": "Insgesamt werden also 16 Module angeboten, von denen im Laufe der Studienstufe mindes-\ntens vier Module (die vier Pflichtmodule) aus den verschiedenen Themenbereichen unterrich-\ntet werden.",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "In each semester the compulsory module of the chosen topic area must be taught; the A-Heft sets focus topics from two topic areas for the central written Abitur exams.",
